      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "으에에에, 어, 어, 어쩌지... ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふえええっ！ど、ど、どうしよう…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "CameraOffset": "TRIPLE_2",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitPos": "POS4",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "실례합니다. 혹시 도움이 필요하신가요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あの、お手伝いいたしましょうか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아뇨! 괘, 괜찮아요! ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "い、いえ！大丈夫です！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…네, 사실 필요해요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…いや、えっと…助けてください…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "자아, 뚝. 누나가 곤란해하잖아요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "さぁ、もう泣き止みましょうね？お姉さんが困っているでしょう？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_MALE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "EmotionEffect": "HEART",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "옳지, 옳지. 씩씩하다, 씩씩하다~.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "なでなで、いい子ですね～。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…정말로 뚝 그쳤어. 고, 고맙습니다…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "本当に泣き止んだ…あ、ありがとうございます…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 114,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": -1.0,
      "CutsceneClear": "CLEARUNIT",
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_MALE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_2",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitPos": "POS3",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "전 린이라고 해요. 그쪽은?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私はリンと申します。そちらは？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아, 제 소개가 늦었네요. 진심을 담은 배송, 배달부 베라입니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あっ、ご挨拶が遅れましたね。真心を運ぶ配達屋のベラです！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이것저것 배달해 봤지만 아이는 저도 처음이라서요...",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "これまで色々と配達してきましたが、子どもは初めてで…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "EmotionEffect": "QMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아이를… 배달한다고요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "子どもを…配達しているのですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "으에, 그, 그게 아니라!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふえっ！そ、そうではなく！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "단골 고객님께서 급한 일이 생겨서, 아이를 어린이집에 데려다 달라고 부탁하셨거든요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "常連のお客様に急用ができてしまって、子どもを保育園まで送ってほしいと頼まれたんです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "항상 가던 길로 안 가니까 아이가 조금 불안했나봐요...",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いつも通る道と違うせいか、不安になって泣いてしまったようです…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그랬군요...",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そうだったのですね…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 25,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "마침 저도 그 근처에 볼일이 있는데, 함께 가실래요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ちょうど私も、その方面に向かう予定なんです。ご一緒してもよろしいですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "헉, 네! 저야 감사하죠!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もちろんです！リンさんがいてくだされば、心強いですから！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "TransitionEffect": "WIPE",
      "TransitionControl": "IN"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 28,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgFileName": "ILLUST_BG_PARK_PUBLIC.png",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_2"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 29,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "TransitionEffect": "WIPE",
      "TransitionControl": "OUT"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 30,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그나저나 아이 달래는 데 엄청 능숙하시네요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それにしても、子どもをあやすのがお上手なんですね！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 31,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "저는 머리가 하얘져서… 업고 뛸까? 라는 생각밖에 못 하고 있었어요...",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "私は頭が真っ白になってしまって…このまま抱えて走った方がいいのかな？とか考えてました…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 32,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "후후, 그런가요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふふっ、そうですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 33,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아까 이 아이는 불안해서 울었을 뿐이니까, 주의를 조금만 돌려주면 돼요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "不安で泣いているようだったので、すこし気を紛らわしてあげただけです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 34,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이야기 같은 것도 좋아요. 아이들은 이야기를 정말 좋아하니까요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "話しかけてあげるのも良いですよ。子どもはお話するのが大好きですから。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 35,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이, 이야기요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "お、お話…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 36,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "에헤헤… 아쉽지만 저는 아는 재미있는 이야기가 없어서…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "えへへ…残念ながら、面白い話はできなくって…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 37,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "흐음, 배달부라고 하셨죠? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "配達屋さんだとおっしゃいましたよね？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 38,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이렇게 해보죠. 배달해 보신 것 중 가장 난감했던 소포는 뭐였나요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "では…今まで配達した中で、一番困った荷物は何でしたか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 39,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "난감했던 소포요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "困った荷物ですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 40,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK2",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "끄응...",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うぅん…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 116,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": -1.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_CHILD_MALE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitPos": "POS5"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 118,
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "CutsceneClear": "CLEARUNIT",
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 41,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_5",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…아! 부자 고객님에게 희귀한 앵무새를 배달한 적이 있어요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…あっ！お金持ちのお客様に、珍しいオウムをお届けしたことがあります。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 42,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_03",
